<title>CAMEROON: SOCCER-CAMEROON BEAT ZIMBABWE IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CAMEROON BEAT ZIMBABWE IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DOUALA, Cameroon 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cameroon beat Zimbabwe 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a World Cup African zone group four qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Bernard Tchoutang 82</p>
<p>Attendance: 80,000</p>
</text>
